From d70fbbad9a0a8350cf553b9cfb34ff081725cdd2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gz <gz@local>
Date: Sat, 27 Jun 2026 16:17:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add GPU composite 2D/3D backend with 3D widgets and GLES
 fixes.

Introduce gpu_composite pipeline, 3D scene/mesh/viewport widgets, and
OpenGL ES / Wayland display fixes for Phase 1 LVGL 2D/3D integration.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
